== Attacks and abilities ==
{{For|strategies for defeating Greydwarf shamans|Aggressive creature strategies#Greydwarf shaman}}

=== Magic attack ===
<ref>The property file for Magic attack is named <u>Greydwarf_shaman_attack</u> and the regular attack file is shared with the standard greydwarf labelled <u>Greydwarf_attack</u>. For clarity, the animation name for the shaman's unique Attack is used instead.</ref> Creates a 7-meter 35-degree conical blast that inflicts [[Poison]] (30 [[Damage types#Poison|Poison]] damage). This ability can be used every 8 seconds within 2–5 meters of a player, making it possible to disable the attack by standing close. This attack cannot be blocked.

=== Attack ===
Swings their hand sideways in a 1.7-meter 90-degree horizontal arc to scratch the player (14 [[Damage types#Blunt|Slash]] damage). This attack can be used every 2 seconds when within 1.2 meters of a player.

=== Heal ===
Lifts both hands up to create a healing mist that heals allies for a total of 20 health, ticking every 0.5 seconds in a 4.32-meter radius around the shaman. However, the effect only lasts for 3.5 seconds, meaning that 17.5 health is healed instead of the full 20.

